                    <ref target="#d27">Document 27</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d37-f5" n="5" xml:id="d37-f5-content">
                <p>No record of an additional NSC meeting on Korea
                    in 1969 was found. The next NSC meeting on Korea
                    was held on March 4, 1970 (see <ref target="#d55">Document 55</ref>).</p>
            </note>
